
### First admin

`{{runScript "ensure-admin:remote"}}` creates the admin of the production database before the first deploy, so nobody else can claim the account: Payload lets the first visitor create a user while the users collection is empty. Once the Worker is deployed, sign in at `/admin` of the production URL with the `ADMIN_EMAIL` and `ADMIN_PASSWORD` of `apps/web/.env.admin`, and create the other editors from Users.
{{#if (ne agentContext false)}}

The whole first deploy of this project, in order, is in [`docs/agents/cloudflare-deploy.md`](docs/agents/cloudflare-deploy.md).
{{/if}}
